  "description": "KUKULCAN.SharedKernel.Database is a reusable database infrastructure library for the KUKULCAN architecture. It provides Entity Framework Core integration, database context abstractions, entity persistence support, interceptors, transaction handling, database provider integration, and cross-cutting database behaviors, enabling consistent and standardized database access across applications, modules, and bounded contexts.\n\n        This release extends the repository with Docker-based PostgreSQL documentation and configuration for the local ATLAS database environment. It also updates the project version information in Directory.Build.props and adds the XML AssemblyVersion and FileVersion assembly metadata fields, improving local development setup and assembly version identification.",
