  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "This release includes the following changes:\n\n            - Added Docker Compose documentation for running PostgreSQL 16 for the local ATLAS database environment.\n            - Added the PostgreSQL Docker configuration under Documentation/Docker/PostgreSQL/compose.yml.\n            - Added the solution entry required to include the Docker documentation.\n            - Updated the Directory.Build.props version information.\n            - Added the XML AssemblyVersion and FileVersion assembly metadata fields.",
